{
  "_about": [
    "Worked cases for a TARGET's `panelExposure` text (#186, WP 5.4): what compile.parse_panel_exposure reads out of it on a grid of `rows` x `cols`.",
    "An entry is `<row>-<col>:<seconds>` or `<row>-<col>:<seconds>x<count>`, 1-based, ASCII digits, entries separated by commas or semicolons.",
    "`panels` is [row, col, exposure_s, count] per panel, each panel once, in grid order (count is null when the entry gave none); `unread` is every entry that does not read, in the order typed: no panel of this grid, no number of seconds above zero, a count below 1, or a panel named a second time.",
    "Graded twice against this one file: server/tests/test_w5_panel_overrides.py against parse_panel_exposure itself, and ui/src/components/flows/framing/__tests__/w5PanelOverridesModel.test.tsx against the modal's mirror (framingModel.ts parsePanelExposure). A case added here is graded on both sides."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {"name": "blank", "text": "", "rows": 2, "cols": 2, "panels": [], "unread": []},
    {"name": "seconds only", "text": "1-1:30", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [[1, 1, 30, null]], "unread": []},
    {"name": "seconds and count", "text": "1-1:30x40", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [[1, 1, 30, 40]], "unread": []},
    {"name": "capital X and spaces", "text": " 2-2 : 45.5 X 8 ", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [[2, 2, 45.5, 8]], "unread": []},
    {"name": "grid order, either separator", "text": "2-2:0.5; 1-1:30,1-2:.25", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [[1, 1, 30, null], [1, 2, 0.25, null], [2, 2, 0.5, null]], "unread": []},
    {"name": "empty chunks", "text": ",1-1:30,,;", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [[1, 1, 30, null]], "unread": []},
    {"name": "leading zeros", "text": "01-001:30", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [[1, 1, 30, null]], "unread": []},
    {"name": "panel outside the grid", "text": "9-9:30", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["9-9:30"]},
    {"name": "column past the last", "text": "1-3:30", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-3:30"]},
    {"name": "row zero", "text": "0-1:30", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["0-1:30"]},
    {"name": "seconds not a number", "text": "1-1:abc", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1:abc"]},
    {"name": "seconds with a unit", "text": "1-1:30s", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1:30s"]},
    {"name": "seconds in exponent form", "text": "1-1:1e2", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1:1e2"]},
    {"name": "zero seconds", "text": "1-1:0", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1:0"]},
    {"name": "negative seconds", "text": "1-1:-5", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1:-5"]},
    {"name": "zero count", "text": "1-1:30x0", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1:30x0"]},
    {"name": "count with no number", "text": "1-1:30x", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1:30x"]},
    {"name": "no colon", "text": "1-1", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1"]},
    {"name": "no seconds", "text": "1-1:", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["1-1:"]},
    {"name": "a panel named twice", "text": "1-1:30, 1-1:40", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [[1, 1, 30, null]], "unread": ["1-1:40"]},
    {"name": "the good and the bad together", "text": "1-1:30, 9-9:30, 2-2:abc, 2-1:60x5", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [[1, 1, 30, null], [2, 1, 60, 5]], "unread": ["9-9:30", "2-2:abc"]},
    {"name": "fullwidth digits are not read", "text": "\uff11-1:30", "rows": 2, "cols": 2,
     "panels": [], "unread": ["\uff11-1:30"]}
  ]
